-- name: Master Section
-- description: One row per canonical material-bearing section, 2024+. One row per distinct canonical master_material section key from 2024 onward. Material, inferred-required/optional, OER/IA, ISBN/FormatType, publisher, and cost fields aggregate the deduplicated Course Materials Use items. Enrollment and course/scope fields come from the complete section_enrollment source. Use/NoUse, no-details/no-materials, Canada, and supply fields are canonical course_material sidecar audits for excluded item keys, including NULL-ISBN audit rows, that co-occur with retained material-bearing sections; they do not define this model's population. Use comprehensive_data for complete source-row audits. Slice by period_sortable, control, level, sector, or state in the GUI notebook builder. Backed by a materialized table. Gotchas: period_sortable YYYY-N (4=Fall); state 'CAN'=Canada; *_cost_avg=(min+max)/2 (NOT a mean); seats_taken=9999 is invalid.
SELECT * FROM master_section
